# HRMS Feature Enhancement — Employee Dashboard, Resource Tracking & Seed Data

Add employee self-service attendance on dashboard, admin resource visibility, and comprehensive 2-month seed data for a realistic 20-employee organization.

## Proposed Changes

### Component 1: Comprehensive Seed Data (20 Employees, 2 Projects, 2 Months of Records)

#### [MODIFY] [seed.js](file:///d:/AG/HRMS%20application/backend/prisma/seed.js)

Complete rewrite of the seed file to generate:

**Users (4 system accounts — unchanged)**
- `superadmin@hrms.com` (SUPER_ADMIN)
- `admin@hrms.com` (ADMIN)
- `manager@hrms.com` (MANAGER)
- `employee@hrms.com` (EMPLOYEE)

**20 Employees across 5 departments:**
| # | Department | Count | Roles |
|---|-----------|-------|-------|
| 1 | Engineering | 8 | 1 Lead + 7 Developers |
| 2 | Human Resources | 3 | 1 HR Manager + 2 HR Staff |
| 3 | Finance | 3 | 1 Finance Lead + 2 Accountants |
| 4 | Marketing | 3 | 1 Marketing Lead + 2 Execs |
| 5 | Operations | 3 | 1 Ops Lead + 2 Coordinators |

**2 Application Development Projects (ACTIVE status):**
1. **NexusHR Mobile App** — Manager: Engineering Lead, 8 assigned employees, ~12 tasks
2. **Customer Portal Revamp** — Manager: Marketing Lead, 8 assigned employees, ~10 tasks
3. **4 employees have NO tasks assigned** (bench resources from HR/Ops)

**2 Months of Historical Data (March 1–April 30, 2026):**
- **Attendance**: ~20 records/working day × ~44 working days = ~880 attendance records. Mix of PRESENT, LATE, HALF_DAY, ABSENT. Realistic check-in/out times (8:45–9:15 AM / 5:30–7 PM)
- **Leaves**: 15–20 leave requests across the 2 months (ANNUAL, SICK, CASUAL). Some APPROVED, some PENDING, some REJECTED
- **Timesheets**: For all employees with tasks, log 7–9 hours/day tied to their assigned tasks
- **Salary Structures**: All 20 employees get salary structures (Basic + HRA + DA + allowances)
- **Payroll Runs**: 2 runs (March 2026, April 2026) with full PayrollRecords for all 20 employees
- **Leave Quotas**: Year 2026 quotas (Annual: 20, Sick: 10, Casual: 5) for all employees

