### Component 5: Task-Based Time Recording

The existing system already links tasks → timesheets. The seed data will ensure:
- Each assigned employee has timesheet entries linked to their tasks
- Task `actualHours` is updated from timesheet aggregations
- Completed tasks have `completedAt` timestamps

No code changes needed — just proper seed data linkage.

